WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
The final phase of the HOIST simulation. A humanoid guides a cable-suspended box over a rectangular landing platform.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
The box continues settling toward the platform. Its position and orientation change while the humanoid maintains or adjusts contact.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.000
The final view shows the box's position relative to the landing platform. This continues the same simulation excerpted in the task overview and method sections; it is not a separate trial. Quantitative outcomes are provided in the results tables.
